⚡️🇧🇷 Just to erase all doubt: With 99.97% of the vote counted, Lula wins. His silly hat and debate gaffes were not dealbreakers for the majority of voters.

A gentle reminder to any followers who were cheering for Flavio Bolsonaro. Benjamin Netanyahu endorsed that man. Flavio pledged “close Israel-Brazil relations” if he won. With Flavio losing, Brazil just dodged a bullet.

